        "title": "He Kaipou Pwanzingh daic guang the",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 He Kaipouc, pwanzingh dai guang the,",
            "Dui kamuatc ranv guang pw the!",
            "Muangh zinghmei $%6 tingpuk chingcliam the,",
            "’Naa khou duppui bamv maek khe;",
            "’Maan ni the, Pou ’khavlou lak cho?",
            "Nang akumh zip ngam cho,",
            "Mikkhipdak ’thuic buhbang makna bam khou,",
            "T’rou kiu ’khou na nai bam khou?",
            "",
            "“Pwanzingh, dui kamuatcme Alat piu ni!",
            "Rim .. kan o!",
            "Pwanzingh $%6 tiikamuatcme punic,",
            "Ravsic $%6 punic, maansei nunc $%6 punic;",
            "Tingpuk, kandih, duipui",
            "Kaipouc bammei,",
            "Rungh ta dui $%6 liak bin ngam zath lak ge;",
            "Hei guay neihlaana Alat piu ni!",
            "Rim .. kan o! rim .. kan o!",
            "Hei guay neihlaana Alat piu ni!",
            "Rim .. key .. kan o!”",
            "",
            "2 He Kaipouc, alung ryanrana,",
            "Khuksun keyna kalum e;",
            "Alung ryanramei kasyng tangc the,",
            "Thauna ata kanlou o!",
            "Paapc lev ryanramei duiluat $%6",
            "Abumaengc liak bin the;",
            "Ai amaan the, amaan the, he Kaipouc!",
            "Katumcna kanlou na ro.",
            "3 He Kaipouc, pingmei 6$% duak the,",
            "Pwanzingh 6$% ’thaekc key dat the;",
            "Zeihlat khou neihchaeng how pat dat the,",
            "Tingkauh dam ai laatow the;",
            "He zianthaymei Thuakloumeipu,",
            "Ata ’patlou ri-o;",
            "Neihlaana ai rungh ’thaekcbamv tangc ni the,",
            "Khou6$% ai zaengthaek ni the."
          ]
        }
      },
